\textbf{Tools:} \small{Linux, Embedded systems} \\
\textbf{Other:} \small{Signal processing, Algorithms, FFT, DFT, FIR filters, IIR filters, Time-frequency analysis, Spectrogram, FFT/DFT/DTFT, FIR/IIR filters, Denoising, Feature extraction, Sensor fusion, Wiener filter, Wiener filters} \\
